          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.22.3+2KI.22.4+2KI.22.5+2KI.22.6+2KI.22.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kings 22.3-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Now in the eighteenth year of his reign, when he had purged the land and the house, he sent Shaphan the son of Azaliah, and Ma-aseiah the governor of the city, and Joah the son of Joahaz, the recorder, to repair the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " his God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They came to Hilkiah the high priest and delivered the money that had been brought into the house of God, which the Levites, the keepers of the threshold, had collected from Manasseh and Ephraim and from all the remnant of Israel and from all Judah and Benjamin and from the inhabitants of Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They delivered it to the workmen who had the oversight of the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and the workmen who were working in the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave it for repairing and restoring the house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They gave it to the carpenters and the builders to buy quarried stone, and timber for binders and beams for the buildings which the kings of Judah had let go to ruin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the men did the work faithfully. Over them were set Jahath and Obadiah the Levites, of the sons of Merari, and Zechariah and Meshullam, of the sons of the Kohathites, to have oversight. The Levites, all who were skilful with instruments of music, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "were over the burden bearers and directed all who did work in every kind of service; and some of the Levites were scribes, and officials, and gatekeepers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While they were bringing out the money that had been brought into the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Hilkiah the priest found the book of the law of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " given through Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Hilkiah said to Shaphan the secretary, “I have found the book of the law in the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "”; and Hilkiah gave the book to Shaphan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaphan brought the book to the king, and further reported to the king, “All that was committed to your servants they are doing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have emptied out the money that was found in the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and have delivered it into the hand of the overseers and the workmen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Shaphan the secretary told the king, “Hilkiah the priest has given me a book.” And Shaphan read it before the king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the king heard the words of the law he rent his clothes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king commanded Hilkiah, Ahikam the son of Shaphan, Abdon the son of Micah, Shaphan the secretary, and Asaiah the king's servant, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Go, inquire of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for me and for those who are left in Israel and in Judah, concerning the words of the book that has been found; for great is the wrath of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " that is poured out on us, because our fathers have not kept the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to do according to all that is written in this book.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Hilkiah and those whom the king had sent",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Syr Vg: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "had sent",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " went to Huldah the prophetess, the wife of Shallum the son of Tokhath, son of Hasrah, keeper of the wardrobe (now she dwelt in Jerusalem in the Second Quarter) and spoke to her to that effect. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And she said to them, “Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel: ‘Tell the man who sent you to me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Behold, I will bring evil upon this place and upon its inhabitants, all the curses that are written in the book which was read before the king of Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because they have forsaken me and have burned incense to other gods, that they might provoke me to anger with all the works of their hands, therefore my wrath will be poured out upon this place and will not be quenched. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But to the king of Judah, who sent you to inquire of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", thus shall you say to him, Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel: Regarding the words which you have heard, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because your heart was penitent and you humbled yourself before God when you heard his words against this place and its inhabitants, and you have humbled yourself before me, and have rent your clothes and wept before me, I also have heard you, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I will gather you to your fathers, and you shall be gathered to your grave in peace, and your eyes shall not see all the evil which I will bring upon this place and its inhabitants.’ ” And they brought back word to the king.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the king sent and gathered together all the elders of Judah and Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king went up to the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", with all the men of Judah and the inhabitants of Jerusalem and the priests and the Levites, all the people both great and small; and he read in their hearing all the words of the book of the covenant which had been found in the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the king stood in his place and made a covenant before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to walk after the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and to keep his commandments and his testimonies and his statutes, with all his heart and all his soul, to perform the words of the covenant that were written in this book. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he made all who were present in Jerusalem and in Benjamin stand to it. And the inhabitants of Jerusalem did according to the covenant of God, the God of their fathers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Josiah took away all the abominations from all the territory that belonged to the people of Israel, and made all who were in Israel serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their God. All his days they did not turn away from following the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of their fathers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
